    <TD STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 50%"><P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><B>VERSUS
