    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; padding-right: 36pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">implement
    an effective marketing strategy to promote awareness of our products and services;</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 72pt; text-indent: -18pt"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</FONT></P>

